OL,3,GNEWSAStates backs move to improve voter
OL,4,Aturnout
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey politicians have agreed to work
OL,7,Fon improving government transparency
OL,8,Fand engaging more directly with the
OL,9,Fdemocratic process in the next four
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FStates members had been debating the
OL,13,FCommon Strategic Policy which lays out
OL,14,Fthe Council of Ministers' priorities
OL,15,Ffor the political term.
OL,17,FDeputy Carina Alves, who proposed an
OL,18,Famendment to add a priority about
OL,19,Ftransparency and democracy, said it was
OL,20,Fabout making sure people had more
OL,21,Faccess to information.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
